WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — rce (ig) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:09.487
<v Narrator>N'oge mbụ, ị na-ede program otu ugboro dị ka otu blueprint dị ọcha, na kọmputa na-emepụta matching koodu n'etiti asụsụ.

2
00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:18.378
<v Narrator>Nke abụọ, inweta niile dị ike ga-enwe ihenhọrọ akọwapụtara n'ihu, na-egbochi mmebi nzuzo tupu ihe ọbụla rụọ ọrụ.

3
00:00:18.458 --> 00:00:27.190
<v Narrator>Nke atọ, ọbụla mgbake na-aga n'ihu na-echetara na-ejigharịrị, ka ị ghara ịkwụ ụgwọ ugboro abụọ maka otu mgbake.
